* 2\) Increase the delay margin corresponding to x KM fiber based on the measurement and calculation of the first O-RU8 found in topology;
  * 3\) Select the maximum delay range after finding all O-RU8;
  * 4\) The delay is adjusted when O-RU8 is added and not adjusted when O-RU8 is withdrawn,
  * Uplink direction:
  * The principle is similar to the downlink case, except that the T\_Cal\_UL setting only involves O-RU8.
